<div class="slide problem" data-title-ko="시장의 문제" data-title-en="Market Problem" data-title-ja="市場の課題">
  <div class="slide-inner">
    <div class="section-label" data-lang="ko">Problem</div><div class="section-label" data-lang="en">Problem</div><div class="section-label" data-lang="ja">課題</div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang="ko">바이브코딩의 <span style="color:#EF4444">3가지 한계</span></div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang="en"><span style="color:#EF4444">3 Limitations</span> of Vibe Coding</div>
