        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="ko">AI가 생성한 웹사이트는 획일적이고 템플릿 느낌의 디자인</div><div class="p-desc" data-lang="en">AI-generated websites look generic and template-like</div><div class="p-desc" data-lang="ja">AI生成のウェブサイトは画一的でテンプレート的なデザイン</div>
        <div class="p-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="p-box"><div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ko">전문 디자인 부재</div><div class="p-box-text" data-lang="en">Lack of Professional Design</div><div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ja">プロデザインの欠如</div></div>
        <div class="p-need red" data-lang="ko">Anti-AI 디자인 모델 필요</div><div class="p-need red" data-lang="en">Anti-AI Design Model Needed</div><div class="p-need red" data-lang="ja">Anti-AIデザインモデル必要</div>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-col">
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="ko">운영 단절</div><div class="p-title" data-lang="en">Operations Gap</div><div class="p-title" data-lang="ja">運用の断絶</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="ko">생성 후 수정·관리·운영은 별도 도구 또는 개발자 필요</div><div class="p-desc" data-lang="en">Post-generation editing, management & operations require separate tools or developers</div><div class="p-desc" data-lang="ja">生成後の修正・管理・運用には別ツールや開発者が必要</div>
        <div class="p-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="p-box"><div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ko">생성 ≠ 운영</div><div class="p-box-text" data-lang="en">Generation ≠ Operation</div><div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ja">生成 ≠ 運用</div></div>
        <div class="p-need orange" data-lang="ko">Full-Lifecycle 통합 플랫폼 필요</div><div class="p-need orange" data-lang="en">Full-Lifecycle Platform Needed</div><div class="p-need orange" data-lang="ja">フルライフサイクル統合プラットフォーム必要</div>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-col">
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="ko">플랫폼 종속</div><div class="p-title" data-lang="en">Platform Lock-in</div><div class="p-title" data-lang="ja">プラットフォーム依存</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="ko">Wix·Squarespace 등은 코드 내보내기 불가, 폐쇄적 구조</div><div class="p-desc" data-lang="en">Wix, Squarespace etc. don't export code — closed ecosystem</div><div class="p-desc" data-lang="ja">Wix・Squarespace等はコード書き出し不可、閉鎖的構造</div>
        <div class="p-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="p-box"><div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ko">코드 소유권 없음</div><div class="p-box-text" data-lang="en">No Code Ownership</div><div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ja">コード所有権なし</div></div>
        <div class="p-need purple" data-lang="ko">오픈 웹 아키텍처 필요</div><div class="p-need purple" data-lang="en">Open Web Architecture Needed</div><div class="p-need purple" data-lang="ja">オープンウェブアーキテクチャ必要</div>
      </div>
    </div>
