<!-- 08 SOLUTION -->
<div class="slide solution" data-title-ko="솔루션" data-title-en="Solution" data-title-ja="ソリューション">
  <div class="slide-inner">
    <div class="section-label" data-lang="ko">Solution</div><div class="section-label" data-lang="en">Solution</div><div class="section-label" data-lang="ja">ソリューション</div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang="ko"><span class="gradient-text">Zaemit</span> — 생성부터 운영까지</div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang="en"><span class="gradient-text">Zaemit</span> — Generation to Operations</div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang="ja"><span class="gradient-text">Zaemit</span> — 生成から運用まで</div>
    <div class="section-desc" data-lang="ko">대화형 AI로 웹사이트를 생성하고, 전문 에디터로 편집하고, 클라우드에 배포·운영까지. 글로벌 유일의 Full-Lifecycle 플랫폼</div>
    <div class="section-desc" data-lang="en">Generate websites with conversational AI, edit with professional editor, deploy & operate on cloud. The world's only Full-Lifecycle platform</div>
    <div class="section-desc" data-lang="ja">対話型AIでウェブサイトを生成し、プロエディタで編集し、クラウドにデプロイ・運用まで。グローバル唯一のフルライフサイクルプラットフォーム</div>
    <div class="solution-flow solution-content">
      <div class="solution-step">
        <div class="step-number">STEP 01</div>
        <div class="step-icon"><svg width="3.125vw" height="3.125vw" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.376 3.622a1 1 0 0 1 3.002 3.002L7.368 18.635a2 2 0 0 1-.855.506l-2.872.838.838-2.872a2 2 0 0 1 .506-.855z"/></svg></div>
        <h3 data-lang="ko">AI 생성</h3><h3 data-lang="en">AI Generate</h3><h3 data-lang="ja">AI生成</h3>
        <p data-lang="ko">URL, PDF, 이미지 업로드 또는 대화로 반응형 웹 자동 생성</p><p data-lang="en">Auto-generate responsive web from URL, PDF, image upload or chat</p><p data-lang="ja">URL, PDF, 画像アップロードまたは対話でレスポンシブウェブ自動生成</p>
      </div>
      <div class="solution-step">
        <div class="step-number">STEP 02</div>
        <div class="step-icon"><svg width="3.125vw" height="3.125vw" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg></div>
        <h3 data-lang="ko">전문 편집</h3><h3 data-lang="en">Pro Edit</h3><h3 data-lang="ja">プロ編集</h3>
        <p data-lang="ko">드래그앤드롭 에디터 + AI 코파일럿으로 디자이너급 완성</p><p data-lang="en">Drag-and-drop editor + AI copilot for designer-grade finish</p><p data-lang="ja">ドラッグ&ドロップエディタ+AIコパイロットでデザイナー級仕上げ</p>
      </div>
      <div class="solution-step">
        <div class="step-number">STEP 03</div>
