<!-- PROBLEM: 바이브코딩의 한계 (from 260303) -->
<div class="slide problem" data-title-ko="시장의 문제" data-title-en="Market Problem" data-title-ja="市場の課題">
  <div class="slide-inner">
    <div class="section-label" data-lang="ko">시장 환경 및 기회</div><div class="section-label" data-lang="en">Market Environment</div><div class="section-label" data-lang="ja">市場環境と機会</div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang="ko">바이브코딩의 한계</div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang="en">Limitations of Vibe Coding</div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang="ja">バイブコーディングの限界</div>
    <div class="section-desc" data-lang="ko">신기하고, 빠르지만 아직은 불안한 전문가용 바이브코딩과 결과물이라서 산업에 적용이 어려움</div>
    <div class="section-desc" data-lang="en">Fascinating and fast, but still unreliable for professional vibe coding &mdash; making it difficult to apply in industry.</div>
    <div class="section-desc" data-lang="ja">興味深く高速だが、プロ向けバイブコーディングとしてはまだ不安定で、産業適用が困難</div>
    <div class="problem-flow">
      <!-- Column 1 -->
      <div class="problem-col">
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="ko">결과물의 불완전성</div>
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="en">Incomplete Output</div>
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="ja">結果物の不完全性</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="ko">개발의 할루시네이션<br>디자인의 AI스러움</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="en">Development Hallucination<br>AI-Looking Design</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="ja">開発のハルシネーション<br>デザインのAIっぽさ</div>
        <div class="p-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="p-box">
          <div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ko">20% 오류,<br>33%의 신뢰도</div>
          <div class="p-box-text" data-lang="en">20% Error Rate,<br>33% Reliability</div>
          <div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ja">20%エラー率、<br>33%の信頼性</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="p-need red" data-lang="ko">오류가 적고 정확하며,<br>탈AI 급 디자인 요구</div>
        <div class="p-need red" data-lang="en">Fewer Errors, Accurate,<br>Non-AI-Level Design Demand</div>
        <div class="p-need red" data-lang="ja">エラーが少なく正確で、<br>脱AI級デザイン需要</div>
      </div>
      <!-- Column 2 -->
      <div class="problem-col">
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="ko">비싼 토큰 소모</div>
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="en">Expensive Token Usage</div>
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="ja">高額なトークン消費</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="ko">프롬프트 제작 요청을 위해 LLM 학습 필요<br>오류가 나도 토큰을 돌려주지 않음</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="en">Requires LLM training for prompt crafting.<br>Tokens are consumed even on failed outputs.</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="ja">プロンプト作成にLLM学習が必要<br>エラーでもトークンは返金されない</div>
        <div class="p-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="p-box">
          <div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ko">종량제 기반 서비스,<br>LLM API 토큰의 5배</div>
          <div class="p-box-text" data-lang="en">Pay-Per-Use Model,<br>5x LLM API Token Cost</div>
          <div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ja">従量制サービス、<br>LLM APIトークンの5倍</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="p-need orange" data-lang="ko">사소한 부분은<br>직접 편집 가능한 기능 요구</div>
        <div class="p-need orange" data-lang="en">Need for Direct Editing<br>of Minor Details</div>
        <div class="p-need orange" data-lang="ja">細かい部分は<br>直接編集可能な機能需要</div>
      </div>
      <!-- Column 3 -->
      <div class="problem-col">
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="ko">복잡한 개발환경</div>
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="en">Complex Dev Environment</div>
        <div class="p-title" data-lang="ja">複雑な開発環境</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="ko">네이티브 개발환경 이해 필요<br>작성된 코드를 직접 호스팅해야 함</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="en">Requires native dev environment knowledge.<br>Must self-host the generated code.</div>
        <div class="p-desc" data-lang="ja">ネイティブ開発環境の理解が必要<br>作成コードを自分でホスティング必要</div>
        <div class="p-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="p-box">
          <div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ko">웹빌더보다 어려움<br>개발자가 반드시 필요</div>
          <div class="p-box-text" data-lang="en">Harder Than Web Builders,<br>Developer Required</div>
          <div class="p-box-text" data-lang="ja">Webビルダーより難しい<br>開発者が必ず必要</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="p-need purple" data-lang="ko">웹기반 원클릭 운영,<br>통합 서비스 요구</div>
        <div class="p-need purple" data-lang="en">Web-Based One-Click Ops,<br>Integrated Service Demand</div>
        <div class="p-need purple" data-lang="ja">Web基盤ワンクリック運営、<br>統合サービス需要</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

